# OctoFit Tracker Frontend Environment Configuration

# IMPORTANT: Set VITE_CODESPACE_NAME to your Codespace name for proper API URL generation
# This value will be used to construct: https://{VITE_CODESPACE_NAME}-8000.app.github.dev/api
#
# To find your Codespace name:
# 1. Check the browser URL bar when using Codespaces
# 2. Or check the CODESPACE_NAME environment variable in the terminal
#
# Example:
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=legendary-meme-7vjv74px7rqcp57w
#
# If VITE_CODESPACE_NAME is not set, the app will use: http://localhost:8000/api

# Uncomment and replace with your actual Codespace name:
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=your-codespace-name
